    "Worker startup includes Node runtime import and public stored-code load, not recompilation; not browser bundle startup",
    "Roundtrip includes worker phases, transport and scheduling; phase sums overlap across workers and cannot be subtracted from wall time",
    "postMessage duration is synchronous enqueue cost, not transfer latency",
    "Supersession uses deliberately delayed reply; cancellation uses forced worker termination",
    "No nested worker tree tested; coordinator owns every worker directly"
  ]
